#ASSERT `s 1163(1) the asset is a non-cash asset` T F F EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 1163(1) the asset is a non-cash asset` T T F EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 1163(1) the asset is a non-cash asset` T F T EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 1163(1) the asset is a non-cash asset` F F F EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 1163(2): arguments: the creation or extinction of an estate, interest or right; the discharge of a liability; the liability is for a liquidated sum.
#ASSERT `s 1163(2) the act is a transfer or acquisition of a non-cash asset` T F F EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 1163(2) the act is a transfer or acquisition of a non-cash asset` F T F EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 1163(2) the act is a transfer or acquisition of a non-cash asset` T T T EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The discharge of a liability for a liquidated sum is outside (b); "includes" does not close the list (fork F15).
#ASSERT `s 1163(2) the act is a transfer or acquisition of a non-cash asset` F T T EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 1163(2) the act is a transfer or acquisition of a non-cash asset` F F F EQUALS NOTHING

