#ASSERT `s 1166 the scheme is an employees' share scheme` T (LIST `s 1166 a bona fide employee or former employee of a subsidiary of the company`, `s 1166 a bona fide employee or former employee of the company's holding company or of a subsidiary of the company's holding company`, `s 1166 a spouse, civil partner, surviving spouse or surviving civil partner of such an employee or former employee`, `s 1166 a minor child or step-child of such an employee or former employee`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 1166 the scheme is an employees' share scheme` F (LIST `s 1166 a bona fide employee or former employee of the company`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
